  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし}).\n\nASPECT: {保|たも}っている indicates ongoing maintenance of a state.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- Xを{保|たも}つ (to maintain X)\n- {健康|けんこう}を{保|たも}つ (to maintain health)\n- {品質|ひんしつ}を{保|たも}つ (to maintain quality)\n- {関係|かんけい}を{保|たも}つ (to maintain a relationship)\n- {距離|きょり}を{保|たも}つ (to keep distance)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {維持|いじ}する (to maintain - more formal)\n- {守|まも}る (to protect/keep)",
